      "message": "fix(ui): pick add-to-selection uses the platform command modifier\n\nEdge and feature picks added to the selection on Ctrl. On macOS Control\nis the secondary click, so Mac users could not Ctrl+click to add. The\nadd key is now egui's command modifier (Cmd on macOS, Ctrl elsewhere),\nthe same key the shortcuts use. Shift keeps its meaning. Windows and\nLinux behaviour is unchanged.\n\nFixes #1238\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Haiku 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
